# --- C.A.N.D.I.D.A.'s own LLM (OpenAI-compatible) ---
# Required to leave mock mode:
CANDIDA_LLM_API_KEY=
# Optional overrides:
# CANDIDA_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# CANDIDA_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
#
# Examples:
# OpenAI:     CANDIDA_LLM_API_KEY=sk-...  (BASE_URL default is fine)
# Groq:       CANDIDA_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
#             CANDIDA_LLM_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
# OpenRouter: CANDIDA_LLM_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
# Local:      CANDIDA_LLM_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1
#             CANDIDA_LLM_MODEL=llama3.2
#             CANDIDA_LLM_API_KEY=ollama
